      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "Get a specific Todoist task using its task ID and return its current details.\nUse this tool when the task ID is already known. If the user identifies a task by name or description instead of an ID, use Get Many Tasks first to find the correct task.",
